#: xonsh.foreign_shells.foreign_shell_data:80
msgid ""
"Whether to forward the sourced script's own stdout/stderr to xonsh's "
"terminal. When False (the default) the script's writes are silently "
"discarded — only the xonsh-injected env/alias/func dumps are parsed out and "
"applied. Useful when sourcing scripts that print banners or diagnostic "
"messages, or for debugging a failing source."
msgstr ""

